    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iron Carnage</strong><br>Two ancient citadels, divided by centuries of hatred, have finally collided in a brutal final clash. Now, only one banner will remain flying in the blood-soaked wind of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is clear: destroy the enemy banner before they bring yours down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a strategic <strong>auto-battler</strong> where every choice matters. Build deadly fortifications, recruit ruthless mercenaries, and lay out devious traps to stop the enemy\u2019s advance. But don\u2019t expect an easy fight \u2014 your opponent will strike back with overwhelming forces, clever tactics, and even warriors who rise from the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong move, and your flag will fall. Use your resources wisely, think ahead, and adapt on the fly. The last banner standing will decide the fate of the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u2013 Beautiful graphics<br>\u2013 Tactical and addictive auto-battler gameplay<br>\u2013 Diverse enemy types with unique behaviors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fortress has fallen \u2014 long live the fortress.</p>",
